    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The \u201cVREW\u201d watermark shown in the bottom right of images and videos is from a free video editing tool and <strong>does not</strong> appear in the actual game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update:</strong> Version 2.0 was released on April 15!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to \u201c10-Second Rule\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A horror/liminal space escape game</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cNo matter what happens\u2026 leave the room after 10 seconds.\u201d</strong><br>You only have a <strong>3-second window</strong> to escape.<br>Be careful. Don\u2019t get caught\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Download now</u></strong><u> and experience the thrill of 10 seconds!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Test Subjects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/a730e8e361d398bc6267b94ab2d18376.poster.avif?t=1744700973\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/a730e8e361d398bc6267b94ab2d18376.webm?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/a730e8e361d398bc6267b94ab2d18376.mp4?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the only one who's been tested.<br>Scattered posters, broken machinery\u2026 and something still moving.<br>You won't proceed unless you <strong>find it</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/8a504e3976517517de7aad91ae3c6563.poster.avif?t=1744700973\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/8a504e3976517517de7aad91ae3c6563.webm?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/8a504e3976517517de7aad91ae3c6563.mp4?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of &quot;10-Second Rule&quot; lies in <strong>tension and awareness</strong>.<br>Act within 10 seconds.<br>The door opens after 10 seconds.<br>You have 3 seconds to escape\u2014or start all over again.<br>But each reset... <strong>something changes</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Room Numbers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/4631d3a053e74975ee6059adecd51ddd.poster.avif?t=1744700973\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/4631d3a053e74975ee6059adecd51ddd.webm?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006930/extras/4631d3a053e74975ee6059adecd51ddd.mp4?t=1744700973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This facility contains countless numbered rooms.<br>1, 2, 3... the further you go, the closer something comes.<br>Will reaching Room 10 lead to freedom?<br>Or is that where the real nightmare begins...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not interested in being a test subject?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too late. The experiment has already started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got feedback or issues while playing?<br>Please leave a review\u2014your voice may lead to future updates and improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >(You don\u2019t <i>need</i> to read below\u2014this is just for those wondering who the game is for.)</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended For:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People with busy schedules who don\u2019t have time for long gaming sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who get bored easily with repetitive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who find complex controls and long tutorials off-putting</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Gameplay</strong>: Each loop lasts just 10 seconds, perfect for quick breaks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Replay Value</strong>: Random elements make every run feel fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Tutorial Needed</strong>: Intuitive controls let anyone jump in right away</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Behind the Game: Why \u201c10-Second Rule\u201d Was Created</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea for <i>10-Second Rule</i> was born from a personal struggle\u2014feeling stuck in the <strong>endless loop</strong> of daily life.<br>After a routine day of university, I realized how repetitive everything felt.<br>Then, I watched a speedrun video online.<br>Seeing a player clear a challenge in just seconds inspired a thought:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cWhat if a game could be resolved in just 10 seconds?\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That idea lit a spark, and I began developing <i>10-Second Rule</i>.<br>My goal was to deliver intense tension and rapid-fire satisfaction in a game anyone could pick up.<br>I can't wait to see how players experience it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: How long is the game?</strong><br>A: There are 3 modes. The shortest mode can be cleared in around <strong>15 minutes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What is the goal of the game?</strong><br>A: To reach a target <strong>experiment room number</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: Are there difficulty settings?</strong><br>A: Yes! There are <strong>three levels</strong>: Easy, Normal, and Hard\u2014fun for beginners and veterans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: What happens if I find bugs or issues?</strong><br>A: Please leave a review! We\u2019ll try to address them in future <strong>updates</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: How long is one session?</strong><br>A: Anywhere from <strong>10 to 60 minutes</strong>, depending on play style and mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download now on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Title</strong>: <i>10-Second Rule</i><br><strong>Genre</strong>: Action, Horror, 8-ban-like, Solo Indie Game<br><strong>Publisher</strong>: Nosan<br><strong>Demo Release Date</strong>: July 23<br><strong>Full Release Date</strong>: February 11<br><strong>Price at Launch</strong>: 390 yen</p>",
